OL,3,GNEWSAThe students looking out for
OL,4,Astudents - and the tools they're using
OL,5,Ato stay safe
OL,6,
OL,7,FBy now students across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fwill be settling into their new
OL,9,Fcourses, accommodation and socialising
OL,10,Fschedules.
OL,12,FBut behind every fresher is a young
OL,13,Fperson "fresh out of high school, new
OL,14,Fto the area, and for many of them it's
OL,15,Ftheir first time living away from
OL,16,Fhome", said Magee student vice
OL,17,Fpresident Shauna Whyte.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
